WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.150
Adipose tissue is an
active participant in the cancer-risk

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:03.556
model.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.442
It releases adipokines.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.840
With obesity, the supplied
deck links insulin resistance and

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.069
hyperinsulinemia.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.687
Watch signaling increase around the tissue.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.540
This is a risk mechanism, not proof that a

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:17.423
tumor will develop.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:22.020
Physical activity can reduce
inflammatory mediators and insulin-like growth

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:22.420
factors.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.700
The packet describes protection
for selected cancers even without

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.200
weight loss.
